  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Electricity Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cote d&#xfffd;Ivoire Regional Compact - Energy Project: This compact includes three main activities: improving the regional electricity market, modernizing Cote d&apos;Ivoire&apos;s electricity grid, and supporting Cote d&#xfffd;Ivoire&#xfffd;s role in the regional market.

- Improving the Regional Electricity Market: The compact will work with the West African Power Pool to help generate a stable regional marketplace for electricity pricing through creating a day-ahead market.
- Modernizing Cote d&#xfffd;Ivoire&#xfffd;s Electricity Grid: The compact will make C&#xfffd;te d&#xfffd;Ivoire&#xfffd;s electricity grid more stable and reliable by upgrading critical tools, equipment, and infrastructure, including battery storage.
- Supporting Cote d&#xfffd;Ivoire&#xfffd;s Role in the Regional Electricity Market: The compact will strengthen C&#xfffd;te d&#xfffd;Ivoire&#xfffd;s leadership in the regional electricity market by aligning the Ivorian electricity sector&#xfffd;s regulations with regional standards, improving financial health, and boosting overall performance.</narrative>
  </description>
